    "updated_at": "2025-03-19T11:32:14Z",
    "body": "Note that Ladybird has implemented the relevant spec requirements for this as currently written, but isn’t passing the relevant WPT tests at https://wpt.fyi/results/dom/traversal/NodeIterator-removal.html?label=master&product=chrome%5Bexperimental%5D&product=firefox%5Bexperimental%5D&product=safari%5Bexperimental%5D&product=ladybird&aligned due to the problem described in the issue description. (That is, due to the WPT tests apparently having been written to match what other engines have implemented — but not written to match the actual spec.)",
